# Styling and Coloring Axes and the Zero-Line

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Section

Style the axis line with `showline`, `linecolor`, `linewidth`, and the
zero-line with `zeroline`, `zerolinecolor`, `zerolinewidth`.

```elixir
alias Plotly.{Figure, Scatter}

x = Enum.map(-5..5, & &1)
y = Enum.map(x, &(&1 * &1 - 10))

Figure.new()
|> Figure.add_trace(Scatter.new(x: x, y: y, mode: "lines"))
|> Figure.update_layout(
  title: "Styling Axes and Zero-Line",
  xaxis: %{
    showline: true,
    linecolor: "black",
    linewidth: 2,
    zeroline: true,
    zerolinecolor: "hotpink",
    zerolinewidth: 4
  },
  yaxis: %{
    showline: true,
    linecolor: "black",
    linewidth: 2,
    zeroline: true,
    zerolinecolor: "hotpink",
    zerolinewidth: 4
  }
)
|> Plotly.show()
```
